    public boolean isPowerOfThree(int n) {
        // check for edge cases
        if (n < 1 || n % 1 != 0) {
            return false;
        }

        // loop through all powers of three until we find one that matches n
        while (true) {
            int power = 1;
            while (power * power <= n) {
                if (power * power == n) {
                    return true;
                }
                power++;
            }
        }
    }
}

This function first checks for edge cases where n is less than 1 or has a non-zero remainder when divided by 1. If so, it returns false immediately.

